---
description: Web and desktop renderer conventions
globs:
  - "apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "apps/desktop/renderer/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
---

- Use strict TypeScript.
- Keep data fetching in services/hooks, not directly in presentation components.
- Do not embed provider or LLM logic in UI components.
- UI components should consume typed domain objects.
- Keep the overlay renderer independent from Electron main-process APIs.
